{"1890650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Citywars Tower Defense", "steam_appid": 1890650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/d995360bcbe55fe5a67f1ddfe4730404.poster.avif?t=1774686001\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/d995360bcbe55fe5a67f1ddfe4730404.webm?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/d995360bcbe55fe5a67f1ddfe4730404.mp4?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Citywars Tower Defense puts you directly on the battlefield. Instead of commanding from above, you fight beside the towers you build to defend your core Crystal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different combat classes such as Archer, Pirate, Fighter and more, each with their own abilities and playstyle. Strike enemies with melee, magic, or ranged weapons and react in real time as waves of monsters push forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/0f56bf337c33e123a540b54cb9ecf6e3.poster.avif?t=1774686001\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/0f56bf337c33e123a540b54cb9ecf6e3.webm?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/0f56bf337c33e123a540b54cb9ecf6e3.mp4?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources found across the map help you expand your defenses and reinforce the towers guarding the Crystal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, build workstations, and craft tools and weapons to improve your efficiency. As your production grows, you’ll unlock stronger tower upgrades and expand your defenses against the enemies threatening the core Crystal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/5910a4a5265f6e88a4e5c18faf73e539.poster.avif?t=1774686001\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/5910a4a5265f6e88a4e5c18faf73e539.webm?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/5910a4a5265f6e88a4e5c18faf73e539.mp4?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you progress and unlock content, you won’t have to do everything alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will recruit workers that produce resources automatically. As your production hub expands, your workforce and manufactories keep the supply lines running while you focus on defending the crystal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/2f6332bef3d3509bf0e0d3f0e5494578.poster.avif?t=1774686001\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/2f6332bef3d3509bf0e0d3f0e5494578.webm?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/2f6332bef3d3509bf0e0d3f0e5494578.mp4?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every biome in Citywars Tower Defense brings new surprises.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore new regions, you unlock fresh strategies and special fighting mechanics that pushes you to get creative. Enemies with special abilities and new threats will constantly test your defenses. Discover themed towers, secret levels, and hidden challenges unique to each environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/c067f44d44446f11e8efab85350cbe4c.poster.avif?t=1774686001\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/c067f44d44446f11e8efab85350cbe4c.webm?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/c067f44d44446f11e8efab85350cbe4c.mp4?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Citywars can be played solo, but the experience truly shines in multiplayer.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with your friends to divide roles and defend the Crystal more effectively. One player gathers resources while another constructs towers. Some manage upgrades while others hold the line against enemies that break through the defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/42be482b923860ae8266ac7b3afb11eb.poster.avif?t=1774686001\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/42be482b923860ae8266ac7b3afb11eb.webm?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/42be482b923860ae8266ac7b3afb11eb.mp4?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine and experiment with new builds every game to find the perfect one!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submerged towers that slow enemies as nearby deaths empower them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magma towers that erupt with magma flows burning nearby enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guardian towers that summon an NPC to hold the front line.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic placement and synergy between towers can mean the difference between survival and collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/5fb30bd3ef5e15f7c751339e4568b702.poster.avif?t=1774686001\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/5fb30bd3ef5e15f7c751339e4568b702.webm?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/5fb30bd3ef5e15f7c751339e4568b702.mp4?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some of the most powerful defenses aren’t easy to find.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and complete secret parkour challenges to unlock hidden towers with unique abilities that expand your defensive strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/25cfaa128405cf56ae19fc6eecc80b60.poster.avif?t=1774686001\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/25cfaa128405cf56ae19fc6eecc80b60.webm?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/25cfaa128405cf56ae19fc6eecc80b60.mp4?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character with biome-themed skins earned throughout your journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character’s appearance becomes a visual mark of your experience, showing other players how far you’ve progressed in Citywars Tower Defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/d995360bcbe55fe5a67f1ddfe4730404.poster.avif?t=1774686001\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/d995360bcbe55fe5a67f1ddfe4730404.webm?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890650/extras/d995360bcbe55fe5a67f1ddfe4730404.mp4?t=1774686001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Citywars Tower Defense puts you directly on the battlefield. Instead of commanding from above, you fight beside the towers you build to defend your core Crystal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different combat classes such as Archer, Pirate, Fighter and more, each with their own abilities and playstyle. Strike enemies with melee, magic, or ranged weapons and react in real time a